0427897eec6d996b30.poster.avif?t=1753187415\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842180/extras/e8500f134f26990427897eec6d996b30.webm?t=1753187415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842180/extras/e8500f134f26990427897eec6d996b30.mp4?t=1753187415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- This game is really fun for streaming on Twitch/Youtube. Srsly - give it a go if you're into that kind of thing.",
